/**
 * Catalogue expansion pack — adds 2 new categories and grows the store to
 * 15 products per category (120 total). Also carries:
 *   - photoQuery: per-product search terms used to look up each product's
 *     unique photo in media.json (generated by the media harvester)
 *   - videoPool: short showcase clips (Mixkit, free license) per category
 */

